cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these notebooks, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "Companion notebooks for: Oracle-centric perspective on structured quantum search applied to lattice sieving"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Three Jupyter notebooks (Qiskit) that reproduce the worked examples of the paper
  "Oracle-centric perspective on structured quantum search applied to lattice sieving".
  The same sieving predicate is realized as a global oracle (Grover search, including a run on
  IBM quantum hardware) and as a local oracle (quantum walk on the Johnson graph J(6,2)),
  and the two realizations are compared.
keywords:
  - quantum search
  - quantum oracle
  - Grover algorithm
  - quantum walk
  - lattice sieving
  - Qiskit
